              '7(d)': { type: 'points', points: ['Lysine has two NH2 groups (one on α-C and one on side chain); therefore requires 2 mol HCl per mol lysine', 'Serine has one NH2 group; requires 1 mol HCl per mol serine', 'Twice the volume of HCl needed for lysine than for serine (or twice as much acid)'], guidance: '2 marks: 1 for lysine having 2 NH2 groups, 1 for twice the volume needed.' },
