              '9(d)': { type: 'points', points: ['If zero order: rate would be constant, but rate decreases (not zero order)', 'If first order: half-life would be constant; t½ for first interval = 420 s, second interval (0.36→0.18) = 840 s — half-lives are different, so not first order', 'Actually for second order, half-life doubles each time → consistent with second order'], guidance: '2 marks: 1 for not zero order (rate not constant), 1 for not first order (half-lives not constant).' },
